{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ask, deduce, unravel\u2014the truth is just one question away.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's this game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you heard of &quot;lateral thinking puzzles&quot;? Also known as &quot;yes/no riddles&quot;\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you read a vague and bizarre scenario. Then, players can ask any number of questions, and the host only answers &quot;yes,&quot; &quot;no,&quot; or &quot;irrelevant,&quot; until the players piece together the full story. <i>Couch Detective</i> is just like that, except this time, <strong>the host is AI,</strong> and you're sitting on the couch, ready to unravel the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/extras/5d0fbf268cb1d849fe6ede508012ddf9.poster.avif?t=1765171786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/extras/5d0fbf268cb1d849fe6ede508012ddf9.webm?t=1765171786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/extras/5d0fbf268cb1d849fe6ede508012ddf9.mp4?t=1765171786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read a super weird prompt (sometimes even a bit funny)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask any yes/no questions, try to deduce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI will answer &quot;yes,&quot; &quot;no,&quot; or &quot;irrelevant&quot; based on your questions, and you piece together the story step by step</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can create puzzles too!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way, we have a creation mode! In creation mode, you just need to input a few keywords, a scenario, or even an ending, and AI will automatically generate a complete lateral thinking puzzle for you\u2014the prompt, the answer, and the logic all set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play it yourself or share it with friends to challenge them. Instantly become a puzzle designer!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600810?t=1765171786","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/f55c13549ee409b10eb8b51904367bc16770a866/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765171786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/e0a325b8885c85ec917c8114a1c10e94121cae33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765171786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/e0a325b8885c85ec917c8114a1c10e94121cae33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765171786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3828720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ask, deduce, unravel\u2014the truth is just one question away.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's this game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you heard of &quot;lateral thinking puzzles&quot;? Also known as &quot;yes/no riddles&quot;\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you read a vague and bizarre scenario. Then, players can ask any number of questions, and the host only answers &quot;yes,&quot; &quot;no,&quot; or &quot;irrelevant,&quot; until the players piece together the full story. <i>Couch Detective</i> is just like that, except this time, <strong>the host is AI,</strong> and you're sitting on the couch, ready to unravel the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/extras/5d0fbf268cb1d849fe6ede508012ddf9.poster.avif?t=1765171786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/extras/5d0fbf268cb1d849fe6ede508012ddf9.webm?t=1765171786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/extras/5d0fbf268cb1d849fe6ede508012ddf9.mp4?t=1765171786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read a super weird prompt (sometimes even a bit funny)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask any yes/no questions, try to deduce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI will answer &quot;yes,&quot; &quot;no,&quot; or &quot;irrelevant&quot; based on your questions, and you piece together the story step by step</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can create puzzles too!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way, we have a creation mode! In creation mode, you just need to input a few keywords, a scenario, or even an ending, and AI will automatically generate a complete lateral thinking puzzle for you\u2014the prompt, the answer, and the logic all set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play it yourself or share it with friends to challenge them. Instantly become a puzzle designer!</p>","developers":["Gamtropy"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600810/a29712888232d7f172c516f69cc393b4b80d2420/header.jpg?t=1765171786","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li